<p class="govuk-body">A tag may be used to check that you are not entering the area. This means you will also have to follow the rules for wearing a tag.</p>
<p class="govuk-body">Make sure you understand all the places you cannot go to, including those not covered by the map.</p>
<p class="govuk-body">If you need to go somewhere within the area in the map or mentioned in the description, ask for permission from <a class="govuk-link" href="/probation-officer" data-tracking-id="licence_condition_help_exclusion_probation_officer_link">your probation officer</a> first.</p>
